<BR>
<TXSPN>Itohime<STYLE ID="4">'s will may have been at work, since they moved sluggishly, but as long as this whole area is </STYLE>Shigatsu Youka<STYLE ID="4">'s territory, these hyphae will come after us wherever we run.</STYLE><PG>
