<BR>
<STYLE ID="14">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="14">, this is what you wanted, right?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="14">　It seems </STYLE><STYLE ID="15">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="14"> was thinking the same thing."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="15">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="14">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="15"> came by just as we were getting ready at the settlement. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="15">It took time to break open that hole underground so we could get through."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">The two voices were, without a doubt, </STYLE><STYLE ID="14">Erika-chan's</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="15">Kotaro-san's</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">But because of the Noh masks and red robes, I couldn't tell who was who.</STYLE><PG>
