{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">I hadn't known why, but I had felt that to avoid the danger we would need lots of Noh masks and </STYLE><STYLE ID="16">red robes</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">.</STYLE><PG>
