<BR>
<STYLE ID="15">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="15">, sinking to a monster... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="15">It's just what it looks like. For it to sense danger, it has to see its target or hear its voice. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="15">If the precognition doesn't work, the Green-Eye Curse-Killing can't happen. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="15">After we touch </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi-chan's</STYLE><STYLE ID="15"> blood, if we don't say a single word, what happens then?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="15">　The curse-killing doesn't happen, does it?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="15">　And with this many of us, it doesn't take much blood either."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="14">"'The dead come forth from the underworld, and uncanny bewitching flowers rise in rows. </STYLE>
