I wanted to repay you, <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi-san</STYLE>, even a little..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">―Thanks to you, </STYLE>Itohime<STYLE ID="4">, everyone's saved.</STYLE><PG>
