{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Nii-sama</STYLE> wanted to make people prosper, and I chose the path of destroying them."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">―There's still time. Just realizing it is amazing, I think.</STYLE><PG>
