{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">Then a terrible, violent pain ran through my whole body, like being struck by lightning and burned at the stake at the same time.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Itohime<STYLE ID="4">'s suffering was reaching me too.</STYLE><PG>
