{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">―It hurts... it's agony...! </STYLE>Itohime<STYLE ID="4">, does it hurt you too...?</STYLE><PG>
"Ngh...! <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi-san</STYLE>, it is because your senses and mine are linked...!
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　</STYLE>Please open your eyes, quickly!<STYLE ID="4"> </STYLE>That will free you from the pain!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">―B-but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
Itohime<STYLE ID="4">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">there's something you want to tell me... you haven't finished saying it, right...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"It is all right. Never mind me...!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">―Hurry and tell me...! I can't... take any more...!</STYLE><PG>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\糸姫赤\糸姫赤.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
