<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{QUAKESTOP "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Shigatsu Youka<STYLE ID="4"> was simply a wild creature.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">It only tried to grow and reproduce.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Then one day, </STYLE>a girl<STYLE ID="4"> was </STYLE><STYLE ID="17" RUBY="つ">possessed</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> by it.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">A living thing seeks the way to reproduce and grow more efficiently and effectively, and evolves.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Her<STYLE ID="4"> pure heart was exploited by the wild creature, which in time gained human intellect and came to rule humans by </STYLE><STYLE ID="18" RUBY="こうかつ">cunning</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> means.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">This was the evolution of </STYLE>Shigatsu Youka<STYLE ID="4">.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">It was an irony.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Because each tried to possess what it could never possess, they ended up as a creature beyond its station, and incomplete.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">A human cannot live on for centuries, and a fungus cannot have intellect.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Break the law of nature, and―</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\山頂\糸姫の木消滅.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "1" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Itohime<STYLE ID="4"> had been taken into the smallest cherry tree, and now it wilted and began to rot.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi-san</STYLE>, can you hear me?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">―Yeah.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\極楽.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\糸姫赤\糸姫赤.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "1" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Through everyone's help, Shigatsu Youka is about to die out completely. 
{PAUSE ""}
The goshinboku in Motoki-cho and the hyphae underground will all die, roots and all."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">―Then Motoki-cho's saved too?</STYLE><PG>
"Yes. By the time today's sun rises, life should return to the way it was. 
{PAUSE ""}
But precognition, of course, 
{PAUSE ""}
and green eyes, 
{PAUSE ""}
and the Green-Eye Curse-Killing, 
{PAUSE ""}
and Droga, 
{PAUSE ""}
and falsificaso, 
{PAUSE ""}
every phenomenon connected to Shigatsu Youka will vanish too."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">―I see... That's how it should be. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">It was never something humans should have touched in the first place.</STYLE><PG>
"<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi-san</STYLE>... that the last person I met was <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE> truly saved me. 
{PAUSE ""}
Shigatsu Youka's greatest mistake was infecting <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE>. 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">You</STYLE> can, in any situation, make the choice that lets everyone be happy. 
{PAUSE ""}
That is why the many people <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE> have saved are always at your side, helping <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE>. 
{PAUSE ""}
I was watching, you know―the smiles of the people <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE> saved."<PG>
"Indeed, <STYLE ID="1">your</STYLE> friends, your family―
{PAUSE ""}
and even the companions you met only today are wounding their own bodies, <STYLE ID="19" RUBY="にえ">offering</STYLE> their blood, to help <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE> destroy Shigatsu Youka."<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">―I'm nothing so grand. When everyone's unhappy, it just hurts me too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">I'm only doing what I want. I'm just too blessed, that's all.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"If so, then <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE> all hold each other up. 
{PAUSE ""}
Motoki-cho... I wanted to see it too. 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>-san and friends like these―a Motoki-cho with them in it must surely be a wonderful place."<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">―Yeah, it's a really good place. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Lots of nature, and the cherry blossoms are beautiful... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">wait, the goshinboku in Central Park was </STYLE>Shigatsu Youka<STYLE ID="4">, wasn't it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">But because that goshinboku was there, Motoki-cho got to be such a wonderful place.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Were my existence and Shigatsu Youka's of even the slightest help to you, <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi-san</STYLE>?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">―If that goshinboku hadn't been there, there'd be no Motoki-cho as it is now. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Maybe </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> and I would never have met. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">No―even my </STYLE><STYLE ID="20">dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="21">mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka's</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> parents too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Without the goshinboku, we might not even exist.</STYLE><PG>
"Cause and effect is a strange thing. 
{PAUSE ""}
There is something I learned from a certain human's intellect. 
{PAUSE ""}
Pandora's box―
{PAUSE ""}
in the box that held every dark side of humanity, all its anger, hatred and despair, a single grain of hope. 
{PAUSE ""}
That hope brought about this miracle... 
{PAUSE ""}
no, this victory by your own hands."<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">―Winning, losing... is that really what this is about...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Huh?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">―No, I don't feel like I won, or like I beat anyone. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">I just wanted to go home to Motoki-cho with everyone.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">―</STYLE>Itohime<STYLE ID="4">?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"The age I lived in was a world of live or die, win or lose. 
{PAUSE ""}
This country has changed, hasn't it. 
{PAUSE ""}
Surely it has become the rich country <STYLE ID="2">Nii-sama</STYLE> wished for."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">―Yeah, but it'll be an even better country.</STYLE><PG>
"<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi-san</STYLE>..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">―Hm?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"It is... time. 
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n11\r\n100\r\n5000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{PAUSE ""}
My body too is about to be gone. Truly, I have caused you so much trouble."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">―Hey, </STYLE>Itohime<STYLE ID="4">.</STYLE><PG>
"Yes?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">―If you're ever born again... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">come to Motoki-cho.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">―Okay?</STYLE><PG>
"Yes, gladly. 
{PAUSE ""}
When that time comes, could I too become someone at <STYLE ID="1">your</STYLE> side who wishes for everyone's happiness?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">―Yeah, I'm sure.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Thank you. 
{PAUSE ""}
Then... until that time, for a little while―"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">―See you, </STYLE>Itohime<STYLE ID="4">.</STYLE><PG>
