<BR>
Itohime<STYLE ID="4"> had said it:</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Shigatsu Youka<STYLE ID="4">―every phenomenon connected to it would vanish.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">So </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kana-chan's</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> eyes, too, were back to the color they should be.</STYLE><PG>
