<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">! Are you okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah! We all shared our blood, after all!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　...That came out weird, huh."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">With a little blood on her face, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> laughed, ha ha ha.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">The tension of a moment ago seemed like a lie beside </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka's</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> smile.</STYLE><PG>
