<STYLE ID="15">"My, my, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="15"> ended up with quite the </STYLE><STYLE ID="22">wife</STYLE><STYLE ID="15"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">child</STYLE><STYLE ID="15">."</STYLE><PG>
