{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7"><TXSPS>"Ah... uuh..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Gaaah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4"><TXSPN>Two human bodies, skin festering, giving off a stench―</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Ojisan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="22">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="22">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="22">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="22">Obasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> ran over to the two of them.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="8"><TXSPS>"Mi... fu... yu... chan..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="22"><TXSPN>"</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="22">! It's me, Mifuyu!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="8"><TXSPS>"I'm... sorry... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">I've... all this time..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="22"><TXSPN>"It's really, really you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="22">!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="22">Obasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> took </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Ojisan's</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> hand.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">But―</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\dressing.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">Ojisan's</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> skin and flesh slithered off his hand, and the bone lay bare.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Shigatsu Youka<STYLE ID="4">'s protection was gone, and their bodies were coming apart like the corpses they were.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">But they seemed to still be conscious.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Shigatsu Youka<STYLE ID="4"> has been destroyed, and yet they're conscious. That means...</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\懐かしの里.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Ojisan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Is it really... really you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Ojisan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8"><TXSPS>"Ugh... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Natsu... mi... chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4"><TXSPN>I knelt beside </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Ojisan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> too.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Ojisan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">! I've wanted to apologize for so long! Because of me, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8"><TXSPS>"No... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Your</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> fault... it wasn't..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="22"><TXSPN>"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="22">! Come here! Let your </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">father</STYLE><STYLE ID="22"> hear your voice!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Still at a loss, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> came toward us too, one fearful step at a time.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">!</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">It's really </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8"><TXSPS>"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">you've grown... so big..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2"><TXSPN>"Yeah! </STYLE><STYLE ID="22">Mom's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> here, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, and everyone, so I'm doing great!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8"><TXSPS>"Good..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8"><TXSPN>Ojisan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> smiled, and the skin around his mouth slipped right off.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="22">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="22">, I'm so glad I married </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="22"> after all!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="22">　I'm so glad I got to be </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">your</STYLE><STYLE ID="22"> wife!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8"><TXSPS>"</STYLE><STYLE ID="22">Mi... fu... yu... cha</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="22"><TXSPN>"No! To watch </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="22"> die, twice...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="22">Obasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> leaned against </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Ojisan's</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> </STYLE><STYLE ID="23" RUBY="むくろ">body</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> and collapsed in tears.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="11">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="11">!"</STYLE><BR>
<STYLE ID="15">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="15">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Beside us, </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="15">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> were gathered around </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7"><TXSPS>"</STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Chi... gaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">... </STYLE><STYLE ID="15">Kota</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11"><TXSPN>"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="11">...! I missed you! All this time, all this time, I wanted to see you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="11">...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Um... I'm Kana..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> seemed at a loss, facing her real </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">mother</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> for the first time.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7"><TXSPS>"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Ka... na</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Let me see... your face... more..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11"><TXSPN>"Mm... Go on, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="11">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> nudged </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> forward with a push on the back.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> still seemed at a loss, but even so she walked over to </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> and crouched beside her.</STYLE><PG>
