<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\n人物2\r\n4\r\n250\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\n人物2\r\n4\r\n250\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n11\r\n50\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> reached out a festering hand and laid it on </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kana-chan's</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> face.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">The rotten skin met her </STYLE><STYLE ID="24" RUBY="ほお">cheek</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> with a wet slap, but </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> didn't resist at all.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Kana-chan's</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> </STYLE><STYLE ID="24" RUBY="ほお">cheek</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> ran with dark red blood from </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Sakura-san's</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> hand.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">As if to thin that blood, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kana-chan's</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> tears mingled with it.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7"><TXSPS>"Hee hee... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">She looks... so much like me... when I was small..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5"><TXSPN>"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Mommy</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Mommy</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">! I missed you so much!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\夏菜サクラ手\夏菜手.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "T" "300" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="16"> clasped </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Sakura-san's</STYLE><STYLE ID="16"> hand where it lay on her face.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">But </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\dressing.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n-200\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\n人物2\r\n4\r\n0\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n123\r\n人物3\r\n4\r\n-250\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n-200\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\n人物2\r\n4\r\n0\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n123\r\n人物3\r\n4\r\n-250\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> was holding only </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Sakura-san's</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> hand.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Sakura-san's</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> hand had rotted through at the wrist and torn off.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2,人物3" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n11\r\n255\r\n5000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"No...! </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Mommy</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">! We finally got to meet...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7"><TXSPS>"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Mommy is... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">so happy... to see you..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5"><TXSPN>"No! I want to stay with </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Mommy</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7"><TXSPS>"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Ka... na</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5"><TXSPN>"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Mommy</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> threw herself over the rotting, reeking </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n11\r\n255\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\山頂\サクラ栄一郎死にかけセピア.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "1" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">―Before long, with those words as their last, the two of them decayed until nothing but bones remained.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Even these fragments of </STYLE>Shigatsu Youka<STYLE ID="4"> could not bring the dead back to life.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">The dead do not come back.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">That is the law of nature.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">The way things should be.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">It's hard to believe these two were moving around until just a moment ago.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">No, it's only natural that I can't believe it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">After all, impossible things happening had become only natural.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">But at the very, very end, I was able to grant an impossible wish: to apologize to </STYLE><STYLE ID="25">the person I'd wanted to apologize to</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="22">Obasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> got to say goodbye to </STYLE><STYLE ID="25">Ojisan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, who had died suddenly before their eyes.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Meeting her </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">mother</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> for the first time, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> got to let her know she was alive and well.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">Surely </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Ojisan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> had not been without awareness.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Shigatsu Youka<STYLE ID="4"> had manipulated them as it pleased, and all along they had been crying out and suffering inside their </STYLE><STYLE ID="23" RUBY="むくろ">bodies</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">Freed from that hold, the two of them were allowed to spend a last moment with their families.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">This after-death </STYLE><STYLE ID="26" RUBY="だんらん">family gathering</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, never normally allowed, may have been what they earned in return for enduring all that pain.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\山頂\花畑.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "1" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n5000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\山頂\花畑朝焼け.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "5000" "0" "0" "" "1" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">By the time every glowing fragment of the tree had fallen to the earth, a new sun was beginning to show its face.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Shiyo 800, April 8―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Today is the anniversary of </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Eiichiro Niimura-san's</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> death.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Was what happened today a miracle, or a nightmare?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">This is what I think.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Today is the day a nightmare that had gone on since 10 years ago―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">no, for 800 years, was finally lifted by a miracle.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">The curse-killings will never happen again.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Precognition, green eyes and Droga are gone, corpses no longer walk, and the world has simply become an ordinary one.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Into this ordinary world shone a morning sun more beautiful than any I had ever seen.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Come on, let's go home. To Motoki-cho."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "1" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah, let's."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "1" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"I'm sleepy..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "1" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="14">"What are you lot saying! The thirteenth-year memorial service goes ahead as planned!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="14">　Not holding the service here in the Arata settlement is unthinkable, barring something extraordinary!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭抱える.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "1" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="2">"What are you talking about! Something way out of the ordinary just happened!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="14">"Please... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="14">I got to see </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Eiichiro's</STYLE><STYLE ID="14"> face one last time. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="14">At least let me mourn him properly."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "1" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="2">"Oh, come on... just say so from the start... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">But isn't the settlement a mess now?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Cherry trees sprouted all over the place, right?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "1" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="11">"Mm... I wonder if the house is wrecked..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "1" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"The exchange diary... it's not scattered all over, is it...?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\死月妖花へ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "1" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "1"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">Each of us seemed to have something on our minds, from grand intentions to small worries, but we decided to go down the mountain together.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Fortunately, nobody was badly hurt, and the bleeding wasn't serious either.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">But this descent was especially hard on bodies we'd pushed all night without sleep.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> rode piggyback on </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> and I lent </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> our shoulders on the way down.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">And held to my chest―</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="8">Ojisan's</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Sakura-san's</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> remains had one more set of remains lying beside them, along with the broken hairpin.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">I wrapped the tiny remains of </STYLE>Itohime<STYLE ID="4"> and the hairpin in a red robe and held them to my chest.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="22">Obasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> held </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Ojisan's</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> remains, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="15">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Sakura-san's</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, in their arms as we came down the mountain together.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地地下扉あく.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "1" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\鉄格子開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地地下3.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "1" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\鍵をかける.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "1" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="11">"Mm... There, that's done. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11">Now, let's head back."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田集落1.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "1" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "1"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "1" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh? Almost no cherry trees came up around here."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Here and there along the path from the secret base to the settlement were holes where cherry trees seemed to have grown.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">But the houses and buildings had not been damaged.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "1" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="14">"Well, bodies are buried in the graveyard, and animal carcasses get buried away from the settlement."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I see, so the cherry trees came up where the bodies were buried."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "1" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"There's that urban legend too, that there are bodies buried under cherry trees."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\新村本家桜なし.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "1" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "1"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">The cherry tree at the Niimura main house had vanished too, as I'd expected.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">. Did </STYLE>Shigatsu Youka<STYLE ID="2"> really disappear...? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">I mean, it's a fungus, right? If even a little piece is left, won't it grow back...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"I can't rule it out. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">But to reach that size again would take thousands of years. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">That might be better left to the Arata of the future."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"So in a few thousand years, cherry trees might sprout here again..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\集落全景.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "1" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Shigatsu Youka<STYLE ID="4">... will it come back to life again someday?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">But I don't think so.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Itohime<STYLE ID="4"> said it:</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Shigatsu Youka<STYLE ID="4"> has been destroyed.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">That's all.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Her<STYLE ID="4"> words are simply what I want to believe.</STYLE><PG>
Itohime<STYLE ID="4">. Today is </STYLE>your<STYLE ID="4"> death anniversary too, isn't it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Rest in peace.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">And get along with </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Nii-sama</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> over there.</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
